+# Design: Future-You Resume Lab
+
+## Canvas and type
+
+- 1920 × 1080, with a 120 px frame and a 120 px footer reserve.
+- Proxima Nova with system sans-serif fallback.
+- Navy `#0d2437` is the stage; paper `#ffffff` carries resume content.
+- Primary text never falls below 40 px. Labels are 22–24 px, uppercase, and letter-spaced.
+
+## Palette
+
+- Navy: `#0d2437`
+- Deep navy: `#0a1e2f`
+- Blue: `#3393d6`
+- Gold: `#eaab2d`
+- Paper: `#ffffff`
+- Cultured: `#f6f6f9`
+- Ink: `#292f35`
+
+## Layout grammar
+
+The persistent top rail identifies the lesson and advances a thin gold progress line. Each beat uses one dominant composition: split comparison, four-card lens, annotated resume, verification checklist, three-route map, short list, or headline rewrite. No scene is a dense dashboard.
+
+## Motion
+
+Elements enter within 1.2 seconds through opacity, vertical travel, and horizontal rule growth. Each clip fades before its boundary. The timeline is paused and seekable; animation state is deterministic at every timestamp.
